                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V = \{ (x,y) \mid d(x,y)\lt\varepsilon/2 \}
                and use the fact that every located real number is either
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
