          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#regularity Regularity
          %p
            Every uniformly regular uniform space is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/regular+topological+space"} regular topological space
            in its uniform topology. For if
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
